lf":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1900440914"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100995#discussion_r1900440914"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1900440914/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":162,"original_line":162,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1900419736,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1900441384","pull_request_review_id":2526909307,"id":1900441384,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5xRm8o","diff_hunk":"@@ -159,7 +159,7 @@ class Variant {\n \t\tBasis *_basis;\n \t\tTransform *_transform;\n \t\tvoid *_ptr; //generic pointer\n-\t\tuint8_t _mem[sizeof(ObjData) > (sizeof(real_t) * 4) ? sizeof(ObjData) : (sizeof(real_t) * 4)];\n+\t\tuint8_t _mem[sizeof(ObjData) > (sizeof(real_t) * 4) ? sizeof(ObjData) : (sizeof(real_t) * 4)]{ 0 };","path":"core/variant.h","commit_id":"d549b98c5cb4b68f38aece3171cd0aac7c63a7a7","original_commit_id":"2ee55aeadcb7b3abba50d23a0e9f58d28a2fc81c","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I've worked out it seems possible to remove the initialization and not get the warning if we add:\r\n```\r\nif (type != NIL)\r\n{\r\n_data = p_variant._data;\r\n}\r\n```\r\nBut then we are exchanging branchless code (always zero) for a branch.\r\n\r\nIt may be possible to hide the warning with:\r\n```\r\n#if defined(__clang__) && (__clang_major__ >= 13)\r\n#pragma clang diagnostic push\r\n#pragma clang diagnostic ignored \"-Wuninitialized\"\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\nBut I'm not yet convinced this is a good idea, in case it trips up sanitizers or security for reading uninitialized data. It's also difficult to get working as I can't reproduce the warning locally on my clang so have to run CI each change. :unamused: \r\n\r\nSo far I'm leaning towards just zeroing it as done in the PR currently.","created_at":"2025-01-01T18:17:49Z","updated_at":"2025-01-01T18:24:51Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100995#discussion_r1900441384","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100995","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1900441384"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100995#discussion_r1900441384"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100995"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1900441384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":162,"original_line":162,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1900419736,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_positi